title: Panzerkreuzer A
subtitle: A political question
tags: event, govt_affairs
is-card: true
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_seen = 1
face-image: img/panzerkreuzer.jpg
view-if: panzerkreuzer_seen = 0 and year = 1928 and month >= 8 and reichswehr_minister_party != "SPD" and spd_in_government = 1
new-page: true

= Panzerkreuzer

The Reichswehr Ministry is demanding the construction of a new battlecruiser, as part of Germany's rearmament. We enthusiastically support this initiative as do our coalition partners bar the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span>. The <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> campaigned on food for children instead of battlecruisers, it is uncertain if they will betray their campaign promises. Only the <span style="color: #8B0000;">**KPD**</span> is sure to vote against, as the <span style="color: #DCCA4A;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> will likely yield to right-wing pressure.

- @vote_two
- @vote_yes
- @vote_no

@vote_two
title: Why not two battlecruisers?
choose-if: in_bourgeois_coalition == 1 and z_relation >= 50 and DNVP_relation >= 50
unavailable-subtitle: Our coalition partners will not allow this.
on-arrival: nationalist_strength += 10; panzerkreuzer_funded = 1; ddp_cohesion -= 1; workers_dvp -= 5; reichswehr_loyalty += 0.07 if reichswehr_loyalty < 1; reichswehr_strength += 20; west_relation -= 1; nationalism += 3*(1-dissent); spd_relation -= 8*(1-dissent)

Remilitarisation and restoring our lost prestige are the priorities of this government, and a capable fleet is critical to this goal. The <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> marshall every resource to change the outcome of the vote, to no avail. The Western Powers raise alarm at our policy.


@vote_yes
title: We will vote yes, for constructing the battlecruiser, naturally.
on-arrival: liberal_strength += 5; panzerkreuzer_funded = 1; coalition_dissent -= 1 if in_grand_coalition; workers_spd -= 3; ddp_cohesion -= 1

<span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span>'s grassroots party members are shocked by their intransigence! Many party branches have begun agitating against the cabinet, and our Reichstag members even plan a full vote on the proposal, contravening the government's decision.

The campaign against the battlecruiser fails, with only the dissident <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> and <span style="color: #8B0000;">**KPD**</span> members voting against. The ship will be built.


@vote_no
title: We will vote no.
subtitle: What are we doing?
choose-if: (liberal_strength + labor_strength) > 1.5*(industrialist_strength + nationalist_strength) and in_grand_coalition == 1
unavailable-subtitle: The party will not allow this.
on-arrival: nationalist_dissent += 10; industrialist_dissent += 5; ddp_cohesion += 1

Not building the battlecruiser would severely alienate our industrialist and nationalist factions. Still, even with our dissenting members, if we can convince the <span style="color: #DCCA4A;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>, we might just scrape enough votes to kill the project.

- @nevermind
- @convince_ddp

@nevermind
title: Nevermind, we will vote for building the ship.
on-arrival: liberal_strength += 5; panzerkreuzer_funded = 1; coalition_dissent -= 1 if in_grand_coalition; workers_spd -= 3; ddp_cohesion -= 1

<span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span>'s grassroots party members are shocked by their intransigence! Many party branches have begun agitating against the cabinet, and our Reichstag members even plan a full vote on the proposal, contravening the government's decision.

The campaign against the battlecruiser fails, with only the dissident <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> and <span style="color: #8B0000;">**KPD**</span> members voting against. The ship will be built.

@convince_ddp
title: Let us campaign against building the ship.
subtitle: -1 resource
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; liberal_strength += 10; labor_strength += 5; nationalist_dissent += 50; industrialist_dissent += 20; ddp_cohesion += 1; ddp_relation += 5*(1-dissent); spd_relation += 8*(1-dissent)
go-to: not_built if (kpd_r + spd_r + ddp_r + dvp_r*(liberal_strength + labor_strength)/100) >= 50; built if (kpd_r + spd_r + ddp_r + dvp_r*(liberal_strength + labor_strength)/100) < 50

We rush a campaign through the Reichstag, emphasizing fiscal responsibility, relations with the West, or even arguing that the budget saved could be redirected as tax cuts for businesses. We have convinced the <span style="color: #DCCA4A;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> to vote against building the ship, we can also expect the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> to unanimously vote no. The <span style="color: #000000;">**Center**</span>'s party discipline ensures they will vote yes, however.

@not_built
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_funded = 0; workers_spd += 5; workers_dvp += 3*(1-dissent); ddp_cohesion += 1; z_relation -= 5; DNVP_relation -= 10; spd_relation += 5*(1-dissent); nationalism -= 2*(1-dissent); dvp_left += 2

We did it! The ship will not be built, we have prevailed against Germany's militarism, the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> is grateful that they were able to keep their campaign promisses and pacifism is starting to gain ground within the <span style="color: #DCCA4A;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>. Unfortunately, the right-wing parties are furious at our actions.

@built
on-arrival: liberal_strength += 5; panzerkreuzer_funded = 1; ddp_cohesion -= 1

Despite our efforts, the battlecruiser will be built.

